From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:59:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add an Edit info dialog on phone and TV

Movie and episode details (phone menu and TV actions) and TV show
details get an Edit info entry opening a Material 3 dialog. Episodes
can jump to the show editor. Edits can be forgotten to go back to
scraped data on the next scrape.
